<title>USA: Unilabs buys remaining Pathologie shares.</title>
<headline>Unilabs buys remaining Pathologie shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>UniHolding Corp said its Unilabs SA unit acquired 49.8 percent of the shares of Pathologie Labor Brunnhof AG in Bern, of which it already possessed a majority stake of 50.2 percent.</p>
<p>Unilabs had management control of such company since its foundation in 1988.</p>
<p>The purchase price is 3.45 million Swiss francs, including the right to dividend for the financial year ending May 31, 1997, the company said.</p>
